@startuml UC14_Logout_Activity_Diagram

title UC14: Logout - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Log out";
:Frontend calls Firebase Client SDK's
sign-out method;
:Firebase Client SDK clears the cached
ID token and refresh token from local
persistence on this device;

note right
  Option A - local-only logout: no
  backend call, no server-side token
  revocation. Other devices/sessions
  remain logged in. A stolen token
  from before logout still works
  elsewhere until it naturally expires.
end note

:Frontend redirects user to
login form (UC1);
stop

@enduml
